er-county"],["ARC or PLC in Mower County","/arc-plc/minnesota/mower-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Mower County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, the most of any pair, and April to May in 30. In 2025 January to February came in at 23% of normal and July to August at 165%. So far in 2026 May to June sits at 58% and June to July at 145%.</p>"}
